                        <TextBlock Margin="0,8,0,0"
                                   Style="{StaticResource LearnMutedTextStyle}"
                                   Text="RGB/BGR channels store raw color components. HSV is often easier for inspection because Hue is color family, Saturation is color strength, and Value is brightness." />
                        <TextBlock Margin="0,5,0,0"
                                   Style="{StaticResource LearnMutedTextStyle}"
                                   Text="Opening this guide does not run Preview/Run, create layers, or change routing. Use HSV, Mean, or Histogram Tool Views and click Preview or Run Review explicitly." />
                        <Border Margin="0,12,0,0"
                                Style="{StaticResource LearnPanelStyle}"
